{"seq":4,"slug":"deferred-vs-forward","title":"延迟渲染与前向渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/deferred-vs-forward","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟渲染与前向渲染\">延迟渲染与前向渲染</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前向渲染（Forward Rendering）和延迟渲染（Deferred Rendering）是两种根本不同的光照管线架构。前向渲染在绘制每个物体时直接计算所有光源的光照，而延迟渲染将几何信息先写入 G-Buffer，再在一个全屏 Pass 中统一计算光照。两种架构各有优劣，现代引擎往往采用混合方案以兼顾两者的长处。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 前向渲染&#10;        A1[遍历物体] --&gt; B1[逐物体设置光源]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[顶点 + 片段着色]&#10;        C1 --&gt; D1[深度测试 + 写入]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 延迟渲染&#10;        A2[几何 Pass] --&gt; B2[写入 G-Buffer]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[光照 Pass]&#10;        C2 --&gt; D2[逐像素光照计算]&#10;        D2 --&gt; E2[合成输出]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 前向渲染\n        A1[遍历物体] --&gt; B1[逐物体设置光源]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[顶点 + 片段着色]\n        C1 --&gt; D1[深度测试 + 写入]\n    end\n    subgraph 延迟渲染\n        A2[几何 Pass] --&gt; B2[写入 G-Buffer]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[光照 Pass]\n        C2 --&gt; D2[逐像素光照计算]\n        D2 --&gt; E2[合成输出]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>前向渲染</th>\n<th>延迟渲染</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光源数量扩展性</td>\n<td>O(物体 × 光源)，受限</td>\n<td>O(像素 × 光源)，良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显存带宽</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（G-Buffer 写入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSAA 支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需要特殊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半透明物体</td>\n<td>直接支持</td>\n<td>需要额外前向 Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材质多样性</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>受 G-Buffer 格式约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过绘制成本</td>\n<td>高（重复光照计算）</td>\n<td>低（几何 Pass 无光照）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择渲染架构的核心考量是场景中的光源数量和几何复杂度。对于光源少于 10 个的场景，前向渲染通常更高效；当场景包含数十甚至上百个动态光源时，延迟渲染的优势就非常明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前向渲染管线\">前向渲染管线</h2><p>前向渲染是最直观的渲染方式：遍历场景中的每个可见物体，在片段着色器中直接计算所有影响该片段的光源贡献。其核心优势在于简单性和对材质系统的无限制支持。</p>\n<p>在多光源场景下，前向渲染的基本策略是在片段着色器中循环遍历所有光源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;&#10;&#10;struct PointLight {&#10;    vec4 positionAndRadius;&#10;    vec4 colorAndIntensity;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(set = 1, binding = 0) uniform LightBuffer {&#10;    PointLight lights[64];&#10;    int lightCount;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(set = 2, binding = 0) uniform CameraData {&#10;    vec3 cameraPos;&#10;    mat4 viewProjection;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;&#10;layout(location = 1) in vec3 fragNormal;&#10;layout(location = 2) in vec2 fragTexCoord;&#10;layout(location = 3) in mat3 fragTBN;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;&#10;    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;&#10;    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);&#10;    vec3 V = normalize(cameraPos - fragWorldPos);&#10;&#10;    vec3 totalLight = vec3(0.03) * albedo;&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; lightCount; i++) {&#10;        vec3 lightPos = lights[i].positionAndRadius.xyz;&#10;        float radius = lights[i].positionAndRadius.w;&#10;        vec3 lightColor = lights[i].colorAndIntensity.rgb;&#10;        float intensity = lights[i].colorAndIntensity.w;&#10;&#10;        vec3 L = lightPos - fragWorldPos;&#10;        float dist = length(L);&#10;        if (dist &gt; radius) continue;&#10;&#10;        L = normalize(L);&#10;        float attenuation = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, radius, dist);&#10;        float NdotL = max(dot(N, L), 0.0);&#10;&#10;        totalLight += albedo * lightColor * intensity * NdotL * attenuation;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    outColor = vec4(totalLight, 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct PointLight {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec4 positionAndRadius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec4 colorAndIntensity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 1, binding = 0) uniform LightBuffer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PointLight lights[64];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int lightCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 2, binding = 0) uniform CameraData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 cameraPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mat4 viewProjection;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) in vec3 fragNormal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) in vec2 fragTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 3) in mat3 fragTBN;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 V = normalize(cameraPos - fragWorldPos);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 totalLight = vec3(0.03) * albedo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; lightCount; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vec3 lightPos = lights[i].positionAndRadius.xyz;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float radius = lights[i].positionAndRadius.w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vec3 lightColor = lights[i].colorAndIntensity.rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float intensity = lights[i].colorAndIntensity.w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vec3 L = lightPos - fragWorldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float dist = length(L);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (dist > radius) continue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        L = normalize(L);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float attenuation = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, radius, dist);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float NdotL = max(dot(N, L), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        totalLight += albedo * lightColor * intensity * NdotL * attenuation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    outColor = vec4(totalLight, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前向渲染的过绘制（Overdraw）问题是主要性能瓶颈。当多个物体在屏幕同一位置重叠时，被遮挡物体的光照计算完全浪费。Z-Prepass 是缓解过绘制的标准方案。</p>\n<p>Forward+ 是前向渲染的改进方案，也称为 Tiled Forward Rendering。它将屏幕划分为若干 Tile（通常 16×16 像素），在 Compute Shader 中为每个 Tile 计算可见光源列表。片段着色器只需遍历当前 Tile 的光源，而不是全部光源，从而大幅降低光照计算复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"g-buffer-设计与几何-pass\">G-Buffer 设计与几何 Pass</h2><p>延迟渲染的第一步是几何 Pass（Geometry Pass），将场景中所有不透明物体的几何信息写入 G-Buffer（Geometry Buffer）。G-Buffer 是一组多渲染目标（MRT），每个附件存储不同的材质和几何属性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[几何 Pass] --&gt; B[G-Buffer]&#10;    subgraph G-Buffer 内容&#10;        C[RT0: Albedo RGB + AO]&#10;        D[RT1: Normal XYZ + Roughness]&#10;        E[RT2: Metallic + Emissive]&#10;        F[Depth Buffer]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; G[光照 Pass]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[几何 Pass] --&gt; B[G-Buffer]\n    subgraph G-Buffer 内容\n        C[RT0: Albedo RGB + AO]\n        D[RT1: Normal XYZ + Roughness]\n        E[RT2: Metallic + Emissive]\n        F[Depth Buffer]\n    end\n    B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; G[光照 Pass]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>典型的 G-Buffer 布局设计需要在信息完整性和带宽之间取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渲染目标</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>存储内容</th>\n<th>每像素字节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RT0</td>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>Albedo.rgb + AO</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RT1</td>\n<td>RGB10A2</td>\n<td>Normal.xy(八面体编码) + Roughness + Metallic</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RT2</td>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>Emissive.rgb + 材质 ID</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depth</td>\n<td>D24S8</td>\n<td>深度 + 模板</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总计</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>法线压缩是 G-Buffer 优化的重要技巧。由于法线是单位向量，只需存储两个分量即可重建第三个。八面体编码（Octahedral Encoding）是目前最常用的法线压缩方法，将三维单位向量映射到二维 [-1, 1] 范围，仅需两个通道即可存储。</p>\n<p>几何 Pass 的片段着色器只负责采样纹理和写入 G-Buffer，不做任何光照计算，因此非常轻量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;&#10;layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D armMap;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;&#10;layout(location = 1) in vec2 fragTexCoord;&#10;layout(location = 2) in mat3 fragTBN;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec4 gAlbedoAO;&#10;layout(location = 1) out vec4 gNormalRoughnessMetallic;&#10;layout(location = 2) out vec4 gEmissive;&#10;&#10;vec2 encodeOctahedral(vec3 n) {&#10;    n /= (abs(n.x) + abs(n.y) + abs(n.z));&#10;    if (n.z &lt; 0.0) {&#10;        n.xy = (1.0 - abs(n.yx)) * vec2(n.x &gt;= 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0, n.y &gt;= 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0);&#10;    }&#10;    return n.xy * 0.5 + 0.5;&#10;}&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;&#10;    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;&#10;    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);&#10;    vec3 arm = texture(armMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;&#10;&#10;    gAlbedoAO = vec4(albedo, arm.r);&#10;    vec2 encodedN = encodeOctahedral(N);&#10;    gNormalRoughnessMetallic = vec4(encodedN, arm.g, arm.b);&#10;    gEmissive = vec4(0.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D albedoMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 1) uniform sampler2D normalMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(set = 0, binding = 2) uniform sampler2D armMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec3 fragWorldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) in vec2 fragTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) in mat3 fragTBN;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec4 gAlbedoAO;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) out vec4 gNormalRoughnessMetallic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) out vec4 gEmissive;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec2 encodeOctahedral(vec3 n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    n /= (abs(n.x) + abs(n.y) + abs(n.z));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (n.z &#x3C; 0.0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        n.xy = (1.0 - abs(n.yx)) * vec2(n.x >= 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0, n.y >= 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return n.xy * 0.5 + 0.5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 albedo = texture(albedoMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 normalTS = texture(normalMap, fragTexCoord).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 N = normalize(fragTBN * normalTS);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 arm = texture(armMap, fragTexCoord).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gAlbedoAO = vec4(albedo, arm.r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec2 encodedN = encodeOctahedral(N);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gNormalRoughnessMetallic = vec4(encodedN, arm.g, arm.b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gEmissive = vec4(0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"光照-pass-与光源体积\">光照 Pass 与光源体积</h2><p>延迟渲染的第二步是光照 Pass（Lighting Pass），读取 G-Buffer 中的几何信息，对每个屏幕像素计算所有影响它的光源贡献。</p>\n<p>对于全局光源（方向光、环境光），绘制一个全屏四边形（Full-screen Quad）即可处理所有像素。对于局部光源（点光源、聚光灯），使用光源体积（Light Volume）优化：只为光源影响范围内的像素执行光照计算。</p>\n<p>点光源的影响体积是一个球体，在屏幕空间表现为一个圆形区域。实际渲染时使用低多边形球体网格代表光源体积，在片段着色器中采样 G-Buffer 并计算光照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LightVolumePass {&#10;  renderPointLights(&#10;    encoder: GPURenderPassEncoder,&#10;    lights: ReadonlyArray&lt;{&#10;      position: [number, number, number];&#10;      radius: number;&#10;      color: [number, number, number];&#10;      intensity: number;&#10;    }&gt;,&#10;    gBufferBindGroup: GPUBindGroup,&#10;    cameraBindGroup: GPUBindGroup,&#10;  ): void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createLightVolumePass = (&#10;  device: GPUDevice,&#10;  sphereMesh: { vertexBuffer: GPUBuffer; indexBuffer: GPUBuffer; indexCount: number },&#10;): LightVolumePass =&gt; ({&#10;  renderPointLights(encoder, lights, gBufferBindGroup, cameraBindGroup) {&#10;    encoder.setPipeline(lightVolumePipeline);&#10;    encoder.setBindGroup(0, gBufferBindGroup);&#10;    encoder.setBindGroup(1, cameraBindGroup);&#10;    encoder.setVertexBuffer(0, sphereMesh.vertexBuffer);&#10;    encoder.setIndexBuffer(sphereMesh.indexBuffer, &#39;uint16&#39;);&#10;&#10;    for (const light of lights) {&#10;      const lightData = new Float32Array([...light.position, light.radius, ...light.color, light.intensity]);&#10;      encoder.setBindGroup(2, createLightBindGroup(device, lightData));&#10;      encoder.drawIndexed(sphereMesh.indexCount);&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LightVolumePass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  renderPointLights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GPURenderPassEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      radius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span styl